WEBVTT

10:36.454 --> 10:39.832
- (NEIGHS)
- Hyah. hyah!

10:42.168 --> 10:47.173
JORAH: Vaes Dothrak -
the city of the horselords.

10:47.882 --> 10:51.761
A pile of mud.
Mud and shit and twigs.

10:51.886 --> 10:55.389
- Best these savages can do.
- These are my people now.

10:55.514 --> 10:57.808
- You shouldn't call them savages.
- I'll call them what I like,

10:57.934 --> 11:01.687
because they're my people.
This is my army.
